# OPIc Sample Answer — Day39

## Hotel Problem Role-play

> Hi, I'm calling about my room. I checked in about an hour ago, but there's a problem with the air conditioner. The room is really hot, and I can't sleep comfortably. I was wondering if you could send someone to check it. If it takes too long to fix, could I move to another room? I don't mind changing rooms as long as it's available. Also, I have an early appointment tomorrow, so I'd really appreciate it if you could help me as soon as possible. Thank you.

---

## Useful Structure

> **I'm calling about...**
> → 상황 설명

> **There's a problem with...**
> → 문제 제시

> **I was wondering if you could...**
> → 요청

> **If..., could I...?**
> → 대안 제시

> **I'd really appreciate it if...**
> → 정중하게 마무리

### 핵심 문장

> **I was wondering if you could send someone to check it.**

오늘은 이 문장 하나를 확실하게 입에 익히는 것을 목표로 하자.
